<title>FRANCE: L'Oreal buys Gillette's Unisa.</title>
<headline>L'Oreal buys Gillette's Unisa.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>French cosmetics group L'Oreal said on Thursday it had purchased Chilean mass-market cosmetics firm Unisa from Gillette.</p>
<p>Unisa employs 370 people and had sales of $17 million in 1995, it said in a statement.</p>
<p>It did not give a price for the acquisition.</p>
</text>
